Output ../img/jump.gif
Set Height 420
Source common.tape

Hide
Type "cd /demo/archive && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "tj project && pwd"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "tj repo && pwd"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "tji"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Type "web"
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Type "pwd"
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
